{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_102_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_102_1000_p", "source_sha256": "0e76a136cb07a2c7ea3aec3b0da2dcdcda4d31fdc5d23c74f75d777bf1193488", "ja": "いたいた。千早ー、取材クルーのスタッフさん達が\nもうすぐ到着するそうだ。準備を始めてくれるか。", "zh": "在这儿呢。千早——采访组的工作人员们\n好像马上就要到了。能麻烦你开始准备吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_102_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_102_1001_002chi", "source_sha256": "22f859559b71ca30b98b9eb4f968fec2a9246014476d5bdaeb70b963a064ad65", "ja": "あ、はい。すぐに……あ。\nあずささん、百瀬さん。お疲れ様です。", "zh": "啊，好的。我马上就……啊。\n梓小姐、百濑小姐，辛苦了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_102_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_102_1002_010azu", "source_sha256": "5b8de9afecefc813e71baf86f47b3ca399c8f955f7dd6b631a36cf67ea72882f", "ja": "お疲れ様♪　今度の公演よろしくね、千早ちゃん。\n私たちもきっちりとがんばるから♪", "zh": "辛苦啦♪ 下次公演就拜托你了，千早。\n我们也会认真加油的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_102_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_102_1003_046rio", "source_sha256": "b679d60ab456e0cd61496e47eb5a9c3eb622f8ee3ee185134bd69fc944136341", "ja": "公演を控えたアイドルの密着取材！なんでしょ？\nとなると、公演も大成功させなくちゃね♪", "zh": "是对即将登台公演的偶像进行跟拍采访，对吧？\n既然这样，公演也得取得大成功才行呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_102_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_102_1004_046rio", "source_sha256": "01c6208cbb9a31f8fdba81c6a273f702c1f4dc3b938fd9795bed1c790aeff8e3", "ja": "ちなみに{$P$}くん、密着って\nどんな感じなの？　まさか、これからず～っと密着！？", "zh": "顺便问一下，{$P$}先生，贴身采访到底是怎么回事？该不会从现在开始就要一直跟着我吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_102_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_102_1005_p", "source_sha256": "a0bd50c69c573653b8ebbc7a9dee2bbb9583c0d255b45f28d6f96b6d15e4a865", "ja": "いや、基本は1日だけ千早にカメラを向けたまま、\nインタビューしたり行動を共にしてもらうくらいかな？", "zh": "不，基本上只是让镜头一直对着千早1天，采访她，或者和她一起行动之类的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_102_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_102_1006_028ari", "source_sha256": "1bb0703776c850e8c41683c9707fb1657a4b4d0a5f8492234d98969c23a3f607", "ja": "行動を共にするだけでも大変なことですよぉ！\nアイドルちゃんと1日を、とととっ、共にするなんて！", "zh": "光是陪同行动就已经很了不得了呀！要和偶像一起度过整整1天，这、这、这！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_102_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_102_1007_p", "source_sha256": "7730678a03dbe567ebcc03b738525a67f6ce5bf48fde904ef33de475512482d6", "ja": "いや、まあ、隣を歩く程度というか……。", "zh": "哎呀，其实也就差不多是在旁边走走而已……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_102_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_102_1008_001har", "source_sha256": "92f760a2da5218fbaf23e49dcde8b6bade1af9ce4c6c42215dce34299a704e19", "ja": "でも、本当に珍しいね。\n千早ちゃん、どうして急に？", "zh": "不过，真的很少见呢。\n千早，你怎么突然……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_102_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_102_1009_002chi", "source_sha256": "71cde25d73fcb14b5e2d94481a347ed915753ed6c499013f50dac3f25a958a64", "ja": "たまたまお話をいただいたの。\n……たしかに、今までなら断っていたと思う。", "zh": "只是碰巧有人找上门来而已。\n……确实，换作以前的我，大概会拒绝吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_102_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_102_1010_002chi", "source_sha256": "c807eb56cc0fcbce1988272486c84678dc7971c2c99082b8b37bc3291fad3ff1", "ja": "ただ今回の公演は、何か残しておきたいと思って。\nソロステージに向かう気持ちとか……いろいろ。", "zh": "不过这次的公演，我想留下些什么。\n比如走向个人舞台时的心情……还有很多。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_102_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_102_1011_010azu", "source_sha256": "98c7ab4a8d20d29aefdc129cc50a3ab934441d679631a31e8716b93a9a3e88bf", "ja": "ソロステージ……。たしか何を歌うか、\nまだ決まってなかったわよね？", "zh": "个人舞台……我记得要唱什么歌，还没决定吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_102_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_102_1012_001har", "source_sha256": "7f5065a0c58db0ad12bb177ddc4fe031649d8fc3db57f2163374293e9f03c0b4", "ja": "あっ！　じゃあ、もしかして\n決まったの、千早ちゃん？", "zh": "啊！那这么说，难道已经决定了吗，千早？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_102_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_102_1013_002chi", "source_sha256": "336d2f2cd1aa4e8691844f35939f12666cd61ac1675bfe9f05eaba6d9fcdafa2", "ja": "ええ。私の久しぶりの劇場公演……。\n決定でいいですか、{$P$}？", "zh": "嗯。我的久违剧场公演……就这么定下来，可以吗，{$P$}？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_102_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_102_1014_p", "source_sha256": "3cdd230828b83f102d9136a21106255305cc374a3a3f13b96fa4417bdf038f2d", "ja": "もちろん。みんなにも教えてあげてくれ。", "zh": "当然。也跟其他人说一声吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_102_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_102_1015_002chi", "source_sha256": "a8eb81bbb1f2c8963418e75d6cb4460ff5a284eef4e1efed771414b6c3d8d534", "ja": "ありがとうございます。では……。今度の公演、\nこの劇場で、今の私が歌いたい歌。それは……。", "zh": "谢谢您。那么……关于下次公演，\n在这座剧场里，现在的我想要唱的歌。那就是……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
